wildos-desktop (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Depend on libcanberra-pulse, so the start-up sound plays through
    PipeWire's PulseAudio service instead of libcanberra's ALSA backend.
    The ALSA backend's player thread could still be inside
    libcanberra-alsa.so when startplasma freed the context after the sound
    ended, and the module was unloaded under it: startplasma-wayland
    segfaulted about 6 seconds into the session and SDDM logged
    "sddm-helper exited with 11", leaving the sign-in screen.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0000

